WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.920
Year-End

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.920
Sale

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:02.710
Hello!

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:03.920
PoPiPa!

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.040
Rock!

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.290
Yoo-hoo!

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:08.580
If they've gathered the both of us here, then...

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:11.830
It's time to duke it out
over advancin' to the finals, eh?

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:12.670
What?!

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.630
Thanks for your patience!

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.880
Sorry for calling you here out of the blue.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.210
No problem. So, um...

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:21.420
Two bands tied for second.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.630
How do you intend to decide
which of us stands on the final stage?

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:31.380
Both RAISE A SUILEN and Poppin' Party
will be allowed to participate in the finals.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:33.330
In other words...

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:37.290
A CONCERT WITH POPIPA!

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:38.710
Hooray!

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:39.460
Arisa!

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.330
Congrats!

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:41.330
Arisa-chan!

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:42.250
For real...?

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.170
Congratulations, CHU2-sama!

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:46.330
Congratulations, everyone!

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:47.880
Yeah. To you, too.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.330
This calls for a celebration.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.500
They certainly seem excited!

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.500
Are you sure about this?
That's three bands, you know.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.000
Of course, not a problem!

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.540
We might have to
rearrange the schedule, though.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.960
Okay, everybody!

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.920
The finals are just around the corner.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.080
Let's work together and try our best!

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.670
Yeah!

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:10.880
Yoshiko-san, the poster design
for the finals is finished.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.580
Can you sign off on it for me?

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:13.670
Let's see here...

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:15.170
Atchan?!

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:25.830
Initial honki no jibun yuzurenakute

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:30.580
Shoudou yubisaki kara emotion!

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:45.290
Ano hi watashi wa shoujo demo otona demo naku

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:50.250
Majirike no nai manazashi de yume dake miteta

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:55.290
Meramera yurayurari moetagiru yoru

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.330
Yuuki o kamishimete tabi ni detanda

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:05.670
Initial hajimete wakiagatta mono wa

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:10.460
Furue karadajuu kara emotion

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:15.330
Naze ni hatenaki yozora ni mukatte

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:21.210
Nandomo onnaji kotoba o sakebitsuzukeru no ka?

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:25.080
Toki ni aimai de miushinau

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.960
Tomadoigachi na jibun demo

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:32.380
"Te ni shita mono" wa imademo koko ni

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:35.040
Initial no sono saki e

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:37.460
Hoshi no kodou kanjite

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:42.130
(Kimi wa) tsuyoku kakinarashiteiru

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:45.130
(Ima mo) kokoro furuwasete

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:47.000
Aishiteiru!

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.960
A CONCERT WITH POPIPA!

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:53.960
Sounds like RAS and PoPiPa
are both headed to the finals.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:55.080
I see...

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.250
A showdown between three bands...

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:58.750
Pressure's on, don't you think?

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:00.830
This changes nothing.

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:03.670
Roselia is destined to reach for the top.

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:08.330
Lisa...

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.960
Let's put on a good show.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.000
You bet!

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.540
Create New Post

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.540
Save Draft

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.540
Upload

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.540
"BanG Dream! Finals"...

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.920
Awesome!

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.790
All I did was make a blog.

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:26.500
When did you run off an' join
the volunteer staff?

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:27.630
A while ago.

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:30.130
The two of you have been
working nonstop lately...

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:33.250
I figured there must be something
I could do to help.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.540
I'll help, too!

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:38.080
Huh?

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.210
Leave the HTTP to me!

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:41.880
Wh-what...?

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:45.790
The finals, Arisa! The finals!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:49.000
Yeah, yeah. I heard you the first hundred times.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.670
What about the setlist?

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:52.420
Do you have any ideas?

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:57.500
Something come to mind?

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.540
I'll join you!

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:10.830
What's the matter, Arisa-chan?

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.710
Well, uh...

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:13.750
So, listen...

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:17.460
How 'bout you guys come to my place
after school today?

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:19.040
Of course.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:20.960
We always hang out at your place after school.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:23.210
Y-you've got a point, I suppose...

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:24.750
It's just...

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:29.250
There's something I'd like you to hear...

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:30.750
Really?! What is it?!

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.000
Wait a minute... A song?!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:32.960
You wrote a song?!

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.420
Please let us hear it!

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.040
Get off my back, would you?!

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.380
Go ahead and have a seat.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:43.670
'Kay!

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:47.130
Uh... You want something to drink?

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:48.710
I brought my own water bottle.

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:50.170
C'mon, hurry!

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:52.920
Shut up! I gotta psych myself up, y'know?!

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:55.750
Don't laugh, even if it sucks.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:56.880
We won't.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.960
Seriously! It's not very good.

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:36.580
Well?

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:37.670
Awesome!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.290
It was wonderful!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:40.960
Yep, I got chills!

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:42.670
Goosebumps and everything!

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:44.170
Y-you mean it?

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:46.420
How long have you been working on this?

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:49.750
Since around the time we decided on
entering the tournament.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.040
I'm not sure why...

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:52.630
Arisa-chan...

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:56.250
There aren't any lyrics,
and I'm open to considering other options...

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.830
But I swear you won't hurt my feelings if it's awful!

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:06.710
It's here to stay.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:08.830
A new song, it is!

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:10.130
Hooray!

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.000
Can you take care of the lyrics?

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:14.670
Are you sure?

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:15.460
Yeah...

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:17.830
You can count on me!

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:20.920
Well then, shall we forge on ahead
to the Budokan with this song?

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.000
Yeah!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.000
Yeah...!

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:24.920
Student Council Room

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.880
BUDOKAN STAGE

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.880
Which way is the front?

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.880
Which way do we face?

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.880
Can they hear us?

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.880
Marina-san, etc.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.880
HERE

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.880
Not a clue...

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:29.580
That turned out great.

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:31.210
Thank you very much!

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:32.330
What's next?

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:33.380
G7.

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:34.880
G7...

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:37.040
Is this a new song?

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.750
Arisa wrote it herself!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.170
Hey, knock it off!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:45.130
I'm glad they're allowing Poppin' Party
to perform with us at the Budokan.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.000
Yup!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:49.000
They say we ended up with 12,762 votes.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:52.420
Hard to believe such an insane number
of people voted for us...

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:55.210
It just goes to show how much
our fans love and support us.

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.040
Right...

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:58.080
All aboard the flavor train!

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.920
Let's send 'em a slice of love right back!

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:01.250
With the works!

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.750
Whew, I'm stuffed...

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.040
You're going to eat our song?

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:06.080
I wonder how it'd taste...?

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.580
A train, huh...?

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:10.790
I think I understand.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.290
It's the same for us.

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:15.630
Wow, this looks pretty good!

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:18.250
Yeah! I'm itching to try it out!

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.210
Express your gratitude

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.040
"Gratitude"...

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.380
This song was written by Sayo.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.210
What?!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.790
The melody popped into my head
after I came down with a fever and collapsed.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.630
I had Minato-san give it a listen...

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:32.250
As a band, we aimed for the stars.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:36.210
But we haven't reached this point
through our strength alone.

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:41.960
This song is a story meant for everyone who has
touched our lives and influenced Roselia in some way.

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:46.710
Sounds great! So, what's it called?

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.290
39 (working title)

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.290
"Thirty-nine"?

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:50.830
"San...kyu"?

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:52.540
Oh! "Thank you"!

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.500
So that's what you meant.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:55.460
Not quite.

00:07:55.460 --> 00:08:01.040
The inspiration for this song came to me
while I had a fever of 39°C.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:02.920
Hence, the temporary title...

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:05.580
I plan on giving it a name fitting of
Roselia's image down the line.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.630
Oh, that makes sense.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.380
The song seems very complex...

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.210
It was such a lovely phrase.

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.080
We might have gotten carried away...

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.670
I'd better work hard, too!

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:19.670
And there's still the tech rider to worry about...

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:24.290
Which way is the front?

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:24.290
Which way do we face?

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:24.290
Can they hear us?

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.420
Seems kind of tiny...

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:25.170
I've got no idea how to approach this.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:27.630
* Lots of lights

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:27.630
* Smoke machines

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:27.630
* Projection on huge screen

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:27.630
* Curving screen

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:27.630
* Plenty of amps

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:27.630
* Lift of some sort, like an elevator

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.630
I'm not even sure which side
is supposed to be the front...

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.750
The stage rotates or something, doesn't it?

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:31.420
Rotates?! Cool!

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:33.130
We aren't going to get thrown off, are we?!

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:35.380
Nobody would perform there if it were that fast.

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:38.130
Speaking of which,
what does Roselia's setup look like?

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:41.790
I'm sorry. We haven't planned
that far ahead yet, either...

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.460
I figured as much...

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.960
What are we gonna do...?

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:50.000
Rei and Massu have performed at
the Budokan before, you know.

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.630
Bold of you to come here, Poppin' Party.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:57.290
Venturing into the heart of RAS' territory...

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:59.290
As expected of such crazy girls.

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:00.670
It's enormous!

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:01.630
And fancy!

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:03.130
There's even a bar counter!

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:04.500
Pay attention to me!

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.830
Want a jerky cookie?

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:06.830
Don't mind if I do!

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:08.750
Those are MINE!

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.630
I'll put on some tea.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:14.460
Would you like seconds?

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:15.250
Please.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:17.170
These spices work surprisingly well.

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:18.000
Right?

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:20.170
So... To what do we owe the visit?

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:22.130
We figured we'd get the lowdown.

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:23.330
The lowdown...?

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.080
You know, the inside scoop!

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:27.330
What are these people talking about?

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:28.710
Y'see...

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:32.210
We heard that LAYER and Massu
have performed at the Budokan before,

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:34.420
so we wanted to ask a few questions.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:37.290
What exactly is the Budokan like?

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:38.790
What's it like...?

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:41.420
Massive.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.330
And it holds a TON of people.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:50.380
And, uh... Lemme think...

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:52.040
It's CRAZY huge!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.330
"CRAZY huge"!

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:58.960
Crap, this girl's practically a Kasumi clone...

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:00.920
Let's see, aside from that...

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:05.630
When the stage rotates during a performance,
it's easy to lose track of which way you're facing.

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:09.460
It might be a good idea to choose a landmark
beforehand so that you don't get turned around.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:10.750
I get it!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:14.130
Now that you mention it,
your body sways when the stage moves.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:17.080
Your music suffers if you aren't
careful to keep your balance.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:19.710
I had no idea...

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:21.880
Quite the difficult stage, eh?

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.540
We'd better do some strength training!

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.540
It's been a while since we've gone for a run.
How 'bout it?

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.540
Let's go!

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:27.920
We oughtta go with 'em!

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:30.330
Excellent idea! I'll teach you the proper form!

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:31.580
No, no...

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.330
No, no, no, no...

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:39.790
First place!

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:40.880
Second!

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:45.880
Damn...

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:47.580
Haven't run that fast in a while.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.960
I sure do hope CHU2-san's alright...

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:51.920
What lap are they on?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:56.210
Why're we doing this in the freezing cold...?

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:58.670
Crazy girls...!

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:02.080
Just a moment!

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:04.580
So fast!

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:06.880
Right this way, please.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:08.080
Thank you.

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:10.080
Welcome, Atchan!

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:11.540
What are you doing here?

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:14.000
We were discussing details of
the upcoming concert.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.040
You're here for an interview, right?

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:16.750
That's right.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:20.170
The plan is to write an in-depth article
about the finalists on my blog.

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:22.830
I'd hoped to ask you guys for an interview, too.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.460
Talk about nerve-wracking!

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:25.790
Hit us with your best shot!

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.540
Asuka... Hurry it up...

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.330
I... I'm ready to drop...

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.750
Oh, of course! Thank you very much!

00:11:42.290 --> 00:11:44.000
How're the lyrics coming along?

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:45.750
You wanna see?

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:47.420
Nope, not until it's done.

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:48.380
Really?

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:49.710
It'd ruin the surprise.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:50.880
Mm-hmm!

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.750
Budokan Song

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.250
Kasumi:

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.250
The lyrics are done!

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:12.210
Mirai Train

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:18.880
Arisa?

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:19.960
Hey...

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.540
I just sent you the lyrics.

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:23.290
Yeah, that's why I called.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:25.080
Does it sound weird?

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:26.630
Uh...

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:28.080
No.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.170
Listen... It's just...

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.000
What's wrong?!

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:36.420
It's, like... insanely good.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.670
You're incredible.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.290
Seriously?!

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:41.580
Yay!

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.000
Sh-shut up!

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:45.290
Thanks a bunch, Arisa!

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:46.330
S-sure...

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:49.130
'Kay, gotta go.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.040
I like it...

00:12:56.040 --> 00:13:00.000
PoPiPa New Song

00:12:56.040 --> 00:13:00.000
(Title pending)

00:12:56.040 --> 00:13:00.000
Mirai Train

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.380
"Mirai Train."

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:03.920
The moment of truth is almost upon us.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:07.750
Yup! Feels like the past few months
practically flew by.

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:09.460
It's almost over!

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:10.750
The battle's just begun, y'know.

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:14.040
But I wanna sparkle and tingle a whole lot more!

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:15.080
There she goes...

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:24.790
What's that, O-Tae-chan?

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:28.880
The tournament's theme song, maybe?

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:30.380
Did you come up with it yourself?

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:31.710
The unofficial version!

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:47.130
Teach me the chords. I'll handle the bass.

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.170
Huh?!

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:50.460
I want to perform this one, too!

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.830
Do you mean... at the Budokan?

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.580
That might be kind of tricky...

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:57.250
But we...! One song isn't...

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:00.670
Rimi-rin...

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:02.580
'Kay, then! Let's invite the others!

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:03.580
What?!

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:06.920
Are you talking about a collaboration?

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:07.830
Yup!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:10.880
We thought it'd be fun to
perform together at the end of the concert!

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.420
Well, you aren't wrong...

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:16.960
However, three bands performing at the finals
was an unforeseen circumstance in and of itself.

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:22.710
Even from an administrative standpoint, making room
for ANOTHER song would be a difficult task...

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:26.920
When we discussed it with Marina-san and
the other staff, they said they'd figure something out.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:28.670
I'm all for it!

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:32.830
Picture this: We team up with our ex-rivals
to fight against, uh...

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:33.830
A common enemy?

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:34.710
Exactly!

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:39.540
An amalgamation of Darkness and Light
transforms into gold with a BANG!

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:44.670
I dunno about the whole "gold" thing,
but the crowd might enjoy it.

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:45.630
Yeah!

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:49.460
If the three of our bands play together,
we're sure to put on a sparkly show!

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:50.580
What do you think?

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:55.080
Unfortunately, there's no time to schedule
face-to-face practice sessions between everyone...

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:58.130
In which case, the dress rehearsal
is our only opportunity...

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.460
We would be going out on a limb...

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.080
Are you aware of that?

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:03.960
Yup!

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.210
Can you play the song for us?

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:09.080
Sure!

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:15.210
The thought of performing at
the same concert was excitin' enough...

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:17.460
But performing TOGETHER?!

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:19.880
Masuki-san, would you please
pinch my cheeks for me?!

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:20.750
You don't mind?

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:21.960
Ooh, soft 'n squishy!

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:23.540
I'm not dreaming...!
Ooh, soft 'n squishy!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:24.500
I'm not dreaming...!

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.630
Personally, I think it sounds like fun.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:28.670
Same here.

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.670
Not interested.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:33.290
CHU2-chan...!

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:36.630
What's our next move?
Roselia's already started practicing by now.

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:38.920
What are we going to tell Yukina-senpai...?

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.960
Speaking of which, what does
Yukina Minato have to say about this?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.960
She agreed under the condition of
tweaking a few things.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:50.460
I see... Then I shall begin work
on the staging design.

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:51.250
Huh?

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:53.920
If we're clear, then hurry up and play the song.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:58.920
Poppin' Party and Yukina Minato
shall bear witness to my true skills as a producer!

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:00.670
Oh, thank God!

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:07.500
Can you believe it's already time
for the dress rehearsal?

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.210
Look at all these snacks!

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:11.710
Gifts from Hello Happy,
PasuPare, and Afterglow.

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:15.210
They said it's the least they could do
since they can't be there to cheer us on.

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.540
What's with the yakisoba?

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:19.250
Tsugu's family is also running
a food stall at the festival.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:20.500
These are the samples.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:22.250
I happen to have some, too.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:23.080
Here!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.630
Oh, I baked some cookies, too.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.920
It's all-you-can-eat!

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.920
Hello, everyone.
Let's have a good dress rehearsal.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.080
It's roomier than I imagined.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.790
Nice and bright, don'tcha think?

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:36.750
Yeah!

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:38.250
RAISE A SUILEN...

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:43.000
I haven't seen you since our showdown, Yukina.

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:44.710
You're right.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:51.080
A-aren't you going to say anything else?!

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:55.130
Oh, LOCK and I brought
homemade rice balls to share.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:57.040
There're jerky rice balls, too!

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.210
I'll take one!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:16:59.420
It's mine!

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:01.830
Hey, guys. Time to get started.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.130
We'll begin with Poppin' Party,

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:06.750
followed by RAISE A SUILEN and Roselia.
Just like the real thing.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:07.790
'Kay!

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:10.750
CHU2...

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.210
let's go over the schedule once more.

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:13.920
Sure!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:14.580
Gotcha.
Right!

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:15.710
Absolutely!

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:27.380
U-um... I've been curious about this
for a while now...

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:28.920
Those T-shirts...

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:31.210
These? They're PoPiPa T-shirts.

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:33.960
We made them especially for
SPACE's final concert.

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:36.960
Do you mind if I take a photo?!

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:38.130
Yay!

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:42.670
RAS is different.

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:43.920
You think so?

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:45.670
You're different, too.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.080
Really...?

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:51.830
Maybe you're right.

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:55.460
All done!

00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:56.830
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.210
Break time!

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:01.580
Take a look at this!

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.880
Atchan's the one who made it.

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:05.540
I see...

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:07.580
It's a nice poster.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:10.500
Way to go, Atchan!

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.580
Jeez, Big Sis...

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:16.830
"BanG Dream! Blast through your dreams"...

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:20.130
Our dreams shot through us
like lightning the moment they began.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:22.790
You always look happy, Toyama-san.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.460
Yup, 'course I am!

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:27.330
Being in a band is a blast...

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:30.580
Those sparkly, tingly feelings never stop!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:36.710
Which explains why
everything shines brightly near you.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:37.670
Huh?

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:40.920
Poppin' Party concerts always seem like fun.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.960
That smile of yours is contagious.

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:46.500
It infects everyone around you,
including other bands.

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:53.500
I'm looking forward to your performance.

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:55.880
Thanks!

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:01.630
Now then, let's move on to
the collaboration rehearsal!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:04.080
Can you scoot in a little closer?

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.130
Uh... There's no room!

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:07.790
Climb on up, CHU2!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.380
I'm staying put.

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:10.830
C'mon, don't be shy!

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:14.170
Fitting everyone up here might be kind of tough...

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.830
Isn't it amazing to see them like this?

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.920
Just wait until we get to the Budokan.

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:22.080
Is everybody ready?

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:23.420
Ready!

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.420
Go ahead, give it a whirl!

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:28.130
So, uh...

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:29.210
Yay!

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:34.330
Huh?

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:37.210
Don't act surprised.
You're the initiator, aren't you?

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:38.920
I'm the... What?

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:40.880
The one who suggested this whole thing, y'know?

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:43.000
You're our main vocalist.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:51.710
Alright, you guys!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.630
Let's do this!

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:04.500
Aren't you going to bed, Atchan?

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.330
No, not yet.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.420
Have you posted your
interview article on the website?

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:10.920
I'm proofreading it right now.

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:12.630
I'm so excited!

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.960
Thanks for letting us answer
a bunch of questions about PoPiPa!

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:18.380
I can't guarantee my writing
will do everyone justice.

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:20.420
Yukina-senpai complimented you.

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:22.540
She thought you were easy to talk to.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.420
Oh yeah? That's good...

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:28.130
The butterflies are setting in.
I can't sleep a wink!

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:30.210
I'M the one who can't sleep.

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:32.330
My big sister performing at the Budokan?

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:33.880
Talk about surreal.

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:35.000
Aww!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:38.420
Hey, can I ask you something?

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.630
What's up? More interview stuff?

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:44.040
What exactly do you mean
when you say "sparkly" and "tingly"?

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:48.670
Sparkly things sparkle, and tingly things tingle!

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:49.670
Be serious.

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:50.670
Huh?!

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:57.630
Atchan, do you remember the time
we went camping when we were little?

00:20:57.630 --> 00:20:58.830
Camping...?

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:00.670
Oh, the twinkling stars?

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:02.000
Yup!

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.670
Sparkling and tingling...

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:07.500
I wanted to find something just like that.

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:10.130
I searched and searched...

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:13.960
Then, I met Arisa...

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.920
Struggled alongside Rimi-rin...

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.330
Played the guitar with O-Tae...

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:22.460
And after Saaya joined us,
we became Poppin' Party!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:25.420
Everyone I meet sparkles.

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:27.920
They give me this tingly feeling inside.

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:33.080
All of a sudden, a ton of new people
had joined me on my journey!

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:36.920
The twinkling stars were my friends!

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:40.000
Your friends, huh...?

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:42.080
You sparkle too, y'know.

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:48.210
Snow!

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:50.790
Look, Mom! Snow!

00:21:56.170 --> 00:22:08.080
Yume uchinuku shunkan ni kimi wa nani o omou no?

00:22:10.210 --> 00:22:12.380
La la la la la la...

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:14.750
La la la la la la...

00:22:14.960 --> 00:22:17.080
La la la la la la...

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:19.170
La la la...

00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:23.880
Hashaginagara itsudemo oikaketeta

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:28.330
Honoka ni hikaru yume no kakera

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:33.290
Zenbu hiroiatsumete tsunaidemita

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:38.580
Minna o terasu hoshi ni natta

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:43.540
Kirameku omoidetachi dakishime

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:48.420
Fumidasu kimi no senaka itooshii

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:49.080
Dakara?

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:53.790
Dare yori mo (kimi to) itsumademo (issho ni)

00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:58.540
Ima kara (minna de) utau yo (sei no de)

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:02.210
Kore ijou matenai kara?

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:03.130
"Sei no!"

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:08.040
Aoi sora ni Yes! BanG! Dream! (Sono yume)

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:12.880
Kaze ni yureru yuuki no uta (Uchinuke!)

00:23:12.880 --> 00:23:22.130
Yakusoku shita ano basho to kimi o tsunaida melody

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:37.790
Next Time: This... This Right Here is the Girl Band Generation!
